<title>POLAND: Rolimpex closes up in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Rolimpex closes up in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Rolimpex closed at 123 zlotys in Warsaw bourse's continuous trade, 1.7 percent higher than their opening price.</p>
<p>BIG, BPH, Debica and Elektrim did not trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>NFI units jumped 7.0 percent to 133.3 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
